{"server":"kr","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-09_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-09","title":"뼈에 사무치는","storyCode":"4-9","avgTag":"작전 후","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-09_end.txt","sourceHash":"56b70ff73dce462fb0949aa565c4e02f88a7014fe3319692ff18a13f3f444726","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메테오라이트","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"프로스트리프, 조심해! 너무 앞으로 나가면 안 돼!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"내 능력은 내가 제일 잘 안다…!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"으, 으아아!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"냉기로 방패를 베어내다니?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"뭐, 뭐지?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"비켜!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메테오라이트","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야! 프로스트리프가 적을 교란하면서 적 지휘관을 향해 움직이고 있어!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"스나이퍼, 캐스터, 프로스트리프 씨를 엄호해 주세요!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"이런…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"무슨 꿍꿍이야, 꼬마 여우?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"네놈이 죄를 뉘우치게 하고, 눈물이 멈추지 않을 고통을 주고서…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"…네놈의 목숨을 앗아가겠다."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"방해하지 마!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"으악!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"거, 검은 아츠…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"빠, 빨리 도망쳐!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"리유니온 멤버","speakerId":"char_1002_nsabr","isRemote":false,"text":"메피스토의 부하들처럼 되고 싶지 않아…!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"메피스토, 이제 도망칠 곳은 없어요!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"이런, 이 녀석들로 로도스 아일랜드를 막는 건 무리였나?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"여태까지 해온 악행의 죗값을 치르세요!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"도망칠 곳은 없다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"꼬마 여우, 나한테 너무 가까이 온 거 아냐?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"그건 내가 네 목숨을 앗아갈 자이기 때문이지."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"사람의 목숨을 모욕하는 놈은…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"목숨을 부지할 자격이 없다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"헤에~"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"그렇구나."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"뭐지, 다리가…?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메테오라이트","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야! 각 방향에서 리유니온 부대가 나타났어! 수가 많지는 않지만…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메테오라이트","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메테오라이트","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"위험해. 저건 눈의 악마 소대…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메테오라이트","speakerId":"char_219_meteo","isRemote":false,"text":"눈의 악마 소대까지… 불러모으다니!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"좋아, 너희한테도 새로운 친구를 소개해줘야겠지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"후후, 이번 무대의 진정한 주인공에게 박수 부탁해~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"북서쪽 얼음 평원의 악몽, 눈의 악마들의 공주…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"프로스트~노바~!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"너희들의 피와 살을, 조금씩, 아주 조금씩…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"얼리고, 깎아서, 가루로 만들어 버릴 거야~!"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"…위험해요…!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트노바","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_light"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트노바","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"메피스토……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트노바","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"제일 먼저, 짐승만도 못한 살인광인 네놈을, 설원에 던져 놓고 얼려 죽여야겠군."},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"우와~ 무서워라~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"메피스토","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"하지만 지금 네 상대인 로도스 아일랜드는 저쪽에 있다고?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_6"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"프로스트리프 씨…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"물러나 주세요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"아미야, 사람들을 데리고 도망쳐."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"안 돼!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"저건… 저건…!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"놈이… 이곳으로 다가오고 있어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"승산은 없다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"훗… 아직 충분히 살았다고는 못하겠지만…"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"너희를 만난 건 정말 행운이었어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"가라."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"아미야","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"프로스트리프 씨?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트리프","speakerId":"char_193_frostl","isRemote":false,"text":"가라고!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_40_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트노바","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"프로스트노바","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"안심해라, 로도스 아일랜드."},{"type":"dialogue","spe